+## Common Epics
+
+| Instrument | Epic |
+|---|---|
+| Bitcoin | CS.D.BITCOIN.CFD.IP |
+| Gold | CS.D.USCGC.TODAY.IP |
+| EUR/USD | CS.D.EURUSD.CFD.IP |
